原盤」に慣れてみるといい。その後でテストに移行しよう。","nextNodeIds":[726700301]},{"nodeId":726700301,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30084,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":2930555370,"text":"どうだ、「エネルギー原盤」の使い方は理解できたか？","nextNodeIds":[726700302,726700304]},{"nodeId":726700302,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1283399754,"text":"あまり複雑じゃない。","nextNodeIds":[726700303]},{"nodeId":726700303,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30084,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":2140359258,"text":"確かに、「教令院」の装置と比べれば、「エネルギー原盤」は簡単のほうだ。","nextNodeIds":[726700306]},{"nodeId":726700306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30084,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":1980656794,"text":"君の実力なら、テストのレベルを上げても問題ないだろう。","nextNodeIds":[726700307]},{"nodeId":726700307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30084,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":2360566514,"text":"通りかかった冒険者から、奇妙な秘境を発見したと聞いた。","nextNodeIds":[726700308]},{"nodeId":726700308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30084,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":298696338,"text":"初めて発見された場所で、中には相当の数の魔物がいる。それに魔物の力も、野外のものより強いだろう。","nextNodeIds":[726700309]},{"nodeId":726700309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30084,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":655340874,"text":"もしそこをテスト場所にできるなら、きっとより全面的なデータが得られるはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[726700310]},{"nodeId":726700310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30084,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":3233617386,"text":"何せ以前の君の活躍も…ゴホッ…見事なものだった。だが実力が高すぎて、逆に「エネルギー原盤」のデータがあまり取れなかった。","nextNodeIds":[726700311]},{"nodeId":726700311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30084,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":965884434,"text":"君なら、このような秘境は大したことじゃないだろう。","nextNodeIds":[726700312]},{"nodeId":726700312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":200403842,"text":"もちろん。","nextNodeIds":[726700313]},{"nodeId":726700313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30084,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":2454668538,"text":"他の人がこう言ったら信用できるか迷うが、君なら絶対問題ないと思うよ、ハハッ…コホンッ。","nextNodeIds":[726700314]},{"nodeId":726700314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30084,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":1728529282,"text":"秘境の場所はマップに記しておこう、テスト任務は頼んだよ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":726700304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2577666234,"text":"よく分からない。","nextNodeIds":[726700305]},{"nodeId":726700305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30084,"speakerName":"ホッセイニ","textMapHash":3579499498,"text":"まあ、当たり前だな。心配するな、君は専門家ではない、基本的な操作だけを覚えればそれでいい。","nextNodeIds":[726700306]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7267002,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30084"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7267006,"order":6,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":3993049532,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7267006,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30084"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[],"talks":[],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7267006,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI